WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:01.801
-Tyler Perry, everybody!

00:00:01.801 --> 00:00:03.235
We're hanging out
with Tyler Perry!

00:00:03.235 --> 00:00:07.039
New movie "Don't Look Up" is
in select theaters December 10th

00:00:07.039 --> 00:00:08.808
and on Netflix December 24th.

00:00:08.808 --> 00:00:11.010
"Don't Look Up" -- The cast
in this movie is insane,

00:00:11.010 --> 00:00:12.145
by the way.
-It's crazy.

00:00:12.145 --> 00:00:14.014
-Leonardo DiCaprio,
Jennifer Lawrence,

00:00:14.014 --> 00:00:16.482
Meryl Streep, Jonah Hill,
Ariana Grande,

00:00:16.482 --> 00:00:18.751
Timothée Chalamet,
Cate Blanchett,

00:00:18.751 --> 00:00:20.653
Mark Rylance, Kid Cudi.

00:00:20.653 --> 00:00:23.189
Adam McKay directed this.

00:00:23.189 --> 00:00:24.456
-And me.
How the hell did I get in there?

00:00:24.456 --> 00:00:26.425
I'm just like, how the hell
did I get in this?

00:00:26.425 --> 00:00:28.728
-How was it?
What's it like going with --

00:00:28.728 --> 00:00:30.830
'Cause you worked
with Adam McKay before.

00:00:30.830 --> 00:00:32.431
-Yeah, I played Colin Powell
on "Vice."

00:00:32.431 --> 00:00:34.800
And I loved that experience,
loved working with him.

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:37.102
He's such a -- He knows
exactly what he wants.

00:00:37.102 --> 00:00:38.504
He knows the humor, the timing.

00:00:38.504 --> 00:00:39.805
It's just great
working with him.

00:00:39.805 --> 00:00:41.974
But he also gives you
the freedom to help create,

00:00:41.974 --> 00:00:44.310
help create the characters
and so on and so forth.

00:00:44.310 --> 00:00:45.611
-He's one of
the best improvisers

00:00:45.611 --> 00:00:47.480
I've ever seen in my life.
-He's so good, man.

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:49.615
He'll be in the back, I'll hear
a voice saying, "Say this."

00:00:49.615 --> 00:00:51.450
And I'll say it,
and just everybody's out.

00:00:51.450 --> 00:00:53.953
So, he's great.
-No, he's unbelievably funny.

00:00:53.953 --> 00:00:56.155
Does Leo improvise, as well?

00:00:56.155 --> 00:00:58.858
-You know, for those -- First
of all, when I first met them,

00:00:58.858 --> 00:01:02.528
they were all -- they were like,
"Okay, hey, I'm Leo,"

00:01:02.528 --> 00:01:04.663
"I'm Jennifer," "I'm Ariana."

00:01:04.663 --> 00:01:06.332
I'm like, "I know
who all of you are.

00:01:06.332 --> 00:01:08.467
I'm like, I just -- Like, "Hi!"

00:01:08.467 --> 00:01:11.638
So we all sit down, and we start
the scene right away.

00:01:11.638 --> 00:01:13.640
And I had to just
keep reminding myself,

00:01:13.640 --> 00:01:15.007
"Don't come out of character

00:01:15.007 --> 00:01:17.376
because you're sitting here
with these Oscar winners.

00:01:17.376 --> 00:01:18.778
Just stay in character."

00:01:18.778 --> 00:01:20.946
But they were so mesmerizing
in their performances.

00:01:20.946 --> 00:01:23.315
So, wasn't a lot of -- I don't
know if he was ad-libbing,

00:01:23.315 --> 00:01:25.051
but what he was doing
I believed.

00:01:25.051 --> 00:01:26.852
He's that damn good.
And you all -- we all know that.

00:01:26.852 --> 00:01:28.788
-Yeah, Leonardo DiCaprio,
he's one of the best.

00:01:28.788 --> 00:01:31.024
And Ariana Grande,
by the way, can act.

00:01:31.024 --> 00:01:33.092
-And funny.
-And super funny.

00:01:33.092 --> 00:01:34.260
-She's hysterical.

00:01:34.260 --> 00:01:36.261
If she wanted to give up
that little singing thing

00:01:36.261 --> 00:01:39.799
that's not going too well
and just do comedy, she could.

00:01:39.799 --> 00:01:41.334
-She could, actually, yeah.

00:01:41.334 --> 00:01:43.469
Do you want to tell everyone
what "Don't Look Up" is about?

00:01:43.469 --> 00:01:46.606
-Yeah, it's poking fun,
but not really,

00:01:46.606 --> 00:01:49.108
at our whole society and
how ridiculous we've become.

00:01:49.108 --> 00:01:50.609
And when something
serious happens

00:01:50.609 --> 00:01:52.978
that could destroy us all,
we don't take it seriously

00:01:52.978 --> 00:01:55.982
because we're all so divided,
kind of like reality.

00:01:55.982 --> 00:01:59.852
But it's so -- just --
You got a clip?

00:01:59.852 --> 00:02:00.819
Can they see the clip?
-Yes, I have a clip.

00:02:00.819 --> 00:02:01.921
I want to show everyone a clip.

00:02:01.921 --> 00:02:04.524
Here's Tyler Perry
in "Don't Look Up."

00:02:04.524 --> 00:02:06.025
Take a look.

00:02:06.025 --> 00:02:08.961
-It's somewhere between six and
nine kilometers across, so...

00:02:08.961 --> 00:02:10.295
-It's big.

00:02:10.295 --> 00:02:14.500
-...it would damage the entire
planet, not just a house.

00:02:14.500 --> 00:02:15.902
You know.
-The entire planet.

00:02:15.902 --> 00:02:17.303
Okay, well, as it's damaging,

00:02:17.303 --> 00:02:19.172
will it hit this one house
in particular

00:02:19.172 --> 00:02:20.506
that's right on the coast
of New Jersey?

00:02:20.506 --> 00:02:22.207
It's my ex-wife's house.
I need it to be hit.

00:02:22.207 --> 00:02:24.810
-Come on, you and Shelly
have a great relationship.

00:02:24.810 --> 00:02:26.379
You stop.
-Listen, in all --

00:02:26.379 --> 00:02:27.847
-You need to stop!

00:02:27.847 --> 00:02:31.517
-I will, but in all fairness,
I actually paid for the house!

00:02:31.517 --> 00:02:36.322
-I'm sorry. Are we --
Are we not being clear?

00:02:36.322 --> 00:02:38.190
We're trying to tell you

00:02:38.190 --> 00:02:41.827
that the entire planet
is about to be destroyed.

00:02:41.827 --> 00:02:43.263
-Okay.
-Okay.

00:02:43.263 --> 00:02:45.665
Well, it's, um, you know, just
something we do around here.

00:02:45.665 --> 00:02:47.934
You know, we just keep
the bad news light.

00:02:47.934 --> 00:02:49.935
-Right.
It helps the medicine go down.

00:02:49.935 --> 00:02:51.937
-Yeah.
-Yeah, yeah.

00:02:51.937 --> 00:02:54.040
-Well done, man!
Well played.

00:02:54.040 --> 00:02:55.508
Tyler Perry, everybody!

00:02:55.508 --> 00:02:58.544
"Don't Look Up" is in select
theaters December 10th

00:02:58.544 --> 00:03:00.213
and on Netflix December 24th.

